      "block_id": "s1:block:03521-03522",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "カウラ、それで犯人に心当たりは？",
      "en": "Kaura, any idea who did it?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03528-03530",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "うーん……それがこの街は治安は悪くないんだけど\n何故か人攫いが結構多くてね……",
      "en": "Hmm... Well, the town's pretty safe, but...\nfor some reason, we've had a lot of kidnappings."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03532-03533",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "そうなのか？",
      "en": "That so?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03535-03536",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "ああ、何か手掛かりがあればいいんだけど……",
      "en": "Yeah, if only we had a clue..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03538-03540",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "手掛かり……か……\n俺の頭に昨夜の夢に出てきた頭と呼ばれていた\n男の名前が浮かぶ｡",
      "en": "A clue... huh...\nFrom last night's dream, the name of\nthe man called Head comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03542-03543",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "マチス、という男は？",
      "en": "A man named Mathis?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03545-03547",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "ああ、それだったら北の黒虎岩を根城にしている\n黒狐団て言う山賊の頭だよ",
      "en": "Yeah, that guy's the head of the Black Fox bandits.\nThey hole up at Black Tiger Rock, north of here."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03549-03550",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "そうか……",
      "en": "I see..."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03552-03553",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "それが、どうかしたのかい？",
      "en": "Why do you ask?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03555-03557",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "いや、大した事ではない\nそれよりも何故口論をしているんだ？",
      "en": "No, it's nothing.\nSo why are you arguing?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03559-03561",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "あ、ああ、此奴らが王女様を捜すとか言って\nカドラ廃坑に行こうとしているからさ",
      "en": "Ah, right. They say they need to find the princess,\nso they're heading to the Kadra abandoned mine."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03567-03568",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "それが、何故いけないと言うのだ",
      "en": "And what is wrong with that?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03574-03576",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "だからそんな大人数で行ったら、廃坑から逃げ出した\n魔物達が街を襲うかもしれないだろ",
      "en": "Because if you go with that many people,\nthe monsters from the mine could attack the town."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03582-03583",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "入口には十分な戦力を残して警護する",
      "en": "We'll leave enough soldiers to guard the entrance."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03589-03590",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Kaura",
      "jp": "信用ならないね",
      "en": "I do not buy it."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03596-03597",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Levia",
      "jp": "何だと……",
      "en": "What...?"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03599-03600",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "さてと……\n口論を再開した二人を残して俺は路地を立ち去ろうとした。",
      "en": "Now then...\nLeaving the two to their argument, I left the alley."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03606-03607",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Refin",
      "jp": "ちょっ、セリカさん止めて下さいよ",
      "en": "H-hey, Celica, please stop!"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03609-03609",
      "page_role": "narration",
      "speaker_en": null,
      "jp": "困ったような顔でレフィンが俺を引き止める。",
      "en": "Refin stops me, looking troubled."
    },
    {
      "block_id": "s1:block:03611-03612",
      "page_role": "dialogue",
      "speaker_en": "Celica",
      "jp": "喧嘩の仲裁はお前の得意とする所だろう",
      "en": "You're good at stopping fights, aren't you?"
    }
  ]
}

